# SPA rewrite for folder (drag-and-drop / CLI) deploys.
#
# netlify.toml is only read on Git-linked builds. On a folder deploy Netlify
# reads redirects from the deployed directory instead, so this file has to
# travel inside dist/. Vite copies public/ into dist/ on every build.
#
# Without it, /build, /dashboard and /eval return 404 on a shared link or a
# refresh, because BrowserRouter routes have no file behind them.
/*  /index.html  200
